OL,3,APolls close as voters in Alberta decide
OL,4,Awhether to have referendum on leaving
OL,5,ACanada
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolls have closed as voters in Alberta
OL,8,Fare deciding whether to have a
OL,9,Freferendum on separating from Canada
OL,11,FEarly results are not looking good for
OL,12,FAlbertans, reports Nadine Yousif in
OL,13,FEdmonton, while Canada's national
OL,14,Fbroadcaster projects that voters have
OL,15,Frejected a proposal to hold a binding
OL,16,Freferendum
OL,18,F"I don't even consider myself to be
OL,19,FCanadian anymore," one voter tells the
OL,20,FBBC, while another calls the vote "a
OL,21,Fturning point in Canada's history"
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
